    <string name="breathe_calm_strap_needed">Strap needed</string>
    <string name="breathe_calm_explainer">The strap buzzes a gentle rhythm just below your current heart rate, a felt metronome to relax toward. It trails your heart down rather than yanking it, and stops on its own.</string>
    <string name="breathe_calm_disclaimer">A relaxation rhythm, not cardiac control. It never paces below a safe rate and you can stop anytime. If your heart rate doesn\'t settle, we\'ll say so plainly.</string>
    <string name="breathe_calm_settling">Settling</string>
